  Description: Prerequisite Region - Mwangi Expanse You are a member of the Bright
    Lions and seek to overthrow the tyrannical reign of Walkena and free Mzali from
    his cruel whims. You're experienced operating undercover and have had to be cautious
    of what you say and who you trust, lest you fall afoul of the god-king's terrible
    punishments. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Charisma
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Deception skill and
    the Mzali Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Lie to
    Me] skill feat.
